<translation id="6398664274442544385">Xavfsiz Alacrium sahifasini ko‘rmoqdasiz.</translation>
<translation id="2028209743487670346">Alacrium logotipi</translation>
<translation id="7690933224612299375">Alacrium yaratilishida <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CHROMIUM" />Chromium<ph name="END_LINK_CHROMIUM" /> ochiq kodli loyiha va boshqa <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_OSS" />ochiq kodli dasturiy ta’minotning<ph name="END_LINK_OSS" /> katta o‘rni bor.</translation>
